<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>One Fair Justice — Stories, Logic & Fairness</title>
    <style>
        body { 
            margin: 0; 
            font-family: 'Georgia', serif; 
            background-image: url('one-fair-justice/FB_IMG_1773730473423.jpg');
            background-repeat: repeat-y;
            background-attachment: fixed;
            color: #ffffff; 
            line-height: 1.7;
        }
        
        header {
            background-color: black;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        
        header img {
            width: 200px;
            height: auto;
            object-fit: contain;
        }
        
        .header-title {
            text-align: center;
            flex: 1;
        }
        
        .header-title h1 {
            font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
            font-size: 3.5em;
            color: white;
            margin: 0;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        
        .content-section {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            gap: 40px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        
        .left-content {
            flex: 1;
        }
        
        .left-content img {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 400px;
            border: 3px solid gold;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }
        
        .nav-link {
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 15px;
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        
        .nav-link a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 1.1em;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        
        .nav-link a:hover {
            color: #ffeb3b;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        
        .right-content {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
        }
        
        .right-content video {
            width: 320px;
            height: 320px;
            border: 3px solid gold;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background-color: black;
        }
        
        .bottom-section {
            padding: 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .bottom-section img {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            border: 3px solid gold;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        
        .corner-images {
            position: relative;
            height: 300px;
            margin: 40px 0;
        }
        
        .corner-images img {
            position: absolute;
            border: 3px solid gold;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }
        
        .bottom-left {
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 300px;
            height: auto;
        }
        
        .bottom-right {
            bottom: 0;
            right: 0;
            width: 250px;
            height: auto;
        }
        
        footer {
            background-color: black;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            margin-top: 40px;
            color: white;
        }
        
        footer a {
            color: #ffeb3b;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        
        footer a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        
        .license-info {
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            border-top: 1px solid #ffeb3b;
            padding-top: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <img src="one-fair-justice/FB_IMG_1773730623504.jpg" alt="Constitutional imagery left">
    <div class="header-title">
        <h1>One Fair Justice</h1>
    </div>
    <img src="one-fair-justice/FB_IMG_1773730630440.jpg" alt="One Fair Justice right">
</header>

<div class="content-section">
    <div class="left-content">
        <img src="one-fair-justice/image000000%20(3).jpg" alt="Fairness concept image">
        <div class="nav-link">
            <a href="kilroid-glitch.github.io">→ Explore Kilroid & Glitch — Stories, Logic & Fairness</a>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="right-content">
        <video controls>
            <source src="one-fair-justice/video000000.mp4" type="video/mp4">
            Your browser does not support the video tag.
        </video>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="bottom-section">
    <img src="one-fair-justice/FB_IMG_1773730659069.jpg" alt="Fairness and justice visual">
    
    <div class="corner-images">
        <img src="one-fair-justice/FB_IMG_1773730450722.jpg" alt="Constitutional scales" class="bottom-left">
        <img src="one-fair-justice/FB_IMG_1773730546487.jpg" alt="Constitution" class="bottom-right">
    </div>
</div>

<footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 One Fair Justice | All Rights Reserved</p>
    <p><a href="https://douglasowens369-beep.github.io">← Return to Main Portfolio</a></p>
    
